$CATEGORY: Vocabulary/HansenQuinn/4/verb

::Q001::[markdown]Which Principal Part of ἐθέλω is ‘ἠθέλησα’?:{
	~%-100%2nd#Incorrect. **ἠθέλησα** is the 3rd Principal Part of **ἐθέλω**, not the 2nd.
	~%-100%4th#Incorrect. **ἠθέλησα** is the 3rd Principal Part of **ἐθέλω**, not the 4th.
	~%100%3rd#Correct: **ἠθέλησα** is the 3rd Principal Part of **ἐθέλω** (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%1st#Incorrect. **ἠθέλησα** is the 3rd Principal Part of **ἐθέλω**, not the 1st.
	~%-100%5th#Incorrect. **ἠθέλησα** is the 3rd Principal Part of **ἐθέλω**, not the 5th.
	~%-100%6th#Incorrect. **ἠθέλησα** is the 3rd Principal Part of **ἐθέλω**, not the 6th.
}


::Q002::[markdown]Pick the 4th Principal Part of θύω.:{
	~%-100%λείψω#Incorrect. **λείψω** is Principal Part 2 of **λείπω** “leave” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%δεδήλωκα#Incorrect. **δεδήλωκα** is Principal Part 4 of **δηλόω** “make clear” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%ἠθέληκα#Incorrect. **ἠθέληκα** is Principal Part 4 of **ἐθέλω** “to be willing” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%δεδίδαχα#Incorrect. **δεδίδαχα** is Principal Part 4 of **διδάσκω** “teach” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%εἴληφα#Incorrect. **εἴληφα** is Principal Part 4 of **λαμβάνω** “take” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%πεπαίδευκα#Incorrect. **πεπαίδευκα** is Principal Part 4 of **παιδεύω** “educate” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%ἦρχα#Incorrect. **ἦρχα** is Principal Part 4 of **ἄρχω** “rule” (Chapter 5).
	~%100%τέθυκα#Correct: **τέθυκα** is the 4th Principal Part of **θύω** (Chapter 3).
}


