	~%-100%want#Incorrect. **βούλομαι** is Principal Part 1 of **βούλομαι** “want” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%steal#Incorrect. **κλέπτω** is Principal Part 1 of **κλέπτω** “steal” (Chapter 7).
}


